      "passport": {
        "label": "Lure Villager",
        "icon": "lure_homlet_native",
        "description": "I can lure a [icon=hommlet]Hommlet native to me. \nThe locals are wary of strangers, it will not be easy. \nBut they are also constantly on the verge of famine. \nI can bait a villager with promises of a secret food cache, safety from the coming hunger.\n\nIt will be interesting to have one of Hommlet’s own as part of me. What secrets do they hide here?",
