      ],
      "notifications": [
        {
          "title": "A Friend In Need",
          "text": "Slowly, I befriended one of the locals. \nPlied them with food, kept them curious with tales of an enormous hidden cache.\nEnough food for the whole village to last a year.\n\nFinally, the villager agreed to see it. Walked with me through the forest, all the way to the cave.\n\nThey are a part of me now. I should absorb the body.",
